#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:1
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "Contribuer"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:3
msgid ""
"Contributions of all kinds are welcome: bug reports, fixes, new providers, "
"tests and documentation. The repository's `CONTRIBUTING.md` holds the "
"authoritative guidelines; this page is a short orientation."
msgstr ""
"Les contributions de toute nature sont les bienvenues : rapports de bogues, "
"corrections, nouveaux fournisseurs, tests et documentation. Le fichier "
"`CONTRIBUTING.md` du dépôt contient les directives faisant autorité ; cette "
"page est une courte présentation."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:7
msgid "Development setup"
msgstr "Mise en place de l'environnement de développement"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:16
msgid ""
"See [Testing](../reference/testing.md) for how the suite is organised and "
"why the `test` extra is the right one."
msgstr ""
"Voir [Tests](../reference/testing.md) pour savoir comment la suite est "
"organisée et pourquoi l'extra `test` est le bon."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:19
msgid "Where to start"
msgstr "Par où commencer"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:21
msgid ""
"Each item below links to the page that describes the current behaviour."
msgstr ""
"Chaque élément ci-dessous renvoie à la page qui décrit le comportement "
"actuel."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:23
msgid ""
"**Close a documented gap** (all listed in [Known issues](../reference/known-"
"issues.md))"
msgstr ""
"**Combler une lacune documentée** (toutes répertoriées dans [Problèmes "
"connus](../reference/known-issues.md))"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:25
msgid ""
"Make `FederatedSearcher` honour `--on-provider-failure abort` and `retry`."
msgstr ""
"Faire en sorte que `FederatedSearcher` respecte `--on-provider-failure "
"abort` et `retry`."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:26
msgid "Register the `monitor` command group in `cli/main.py`."
msgstr "Enregistrer le groupe de commandes `monitor` dans `cli/main.py`."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:27
msgid ""
"Connect the [Settings layer](../reference/configuration.md) to search, "
"download and the engine."
msgstr ""
"Connecter la [couche Settings](../reference/configuration.md) à la "
"recherche, au téléchargement et au moteur."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:28
msgid ""
"Fix `client.sar.coherence` for complex input by reusing the approach in "
"`pygeofetch.sar.processor`."
msgstr ""
"Corriger `client.sar.coherence` pour les entrées complexes en réutilisant "
"l'approche de `pygeofetch.sar.processor`."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:29
msgid "Declare `rich` and `shapely` as dependencies."
msgstr "Déclarer `rich` et `shapely` comme dépendances."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:30
msgid "Delete the stale `multisensor/_init.py`."
msgstr "Supprimer le fichier obsolète `multisensor/_init.py`."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:32
msgid "**Improve quality**"
msgstr "**Améliorer la qualité**"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:34
msgid ""
"Add a GCS export test with a mocked bucket, to match the S3 coverage in "
"`tests/test_pipeline_process_export.py`."
msgstr ""
"Ajouter un test d'export GCS avec un bucket simulé (mock), pour égaler la "
"couverture S3 de `tests/test_pipeline_process_export.py`."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:35
msgid ""
"Add post-processing actions (see [Pipelines](../workflows/pipelines.md))."
msgstr ""
"Ajouter des actions de post-traitement (voir "
"[Pipelines](../workflows/pipelines.md))."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:36
msgid ""
"Extend terrain-corrected change detection beyond the cosine correction to "
"C-correction, Minnaert or SCS+C for steep terrain ([Multi-sensor "
"pipelines](../processing/multisensor.md))."
msgstr ""
"Étendre la détection de changement optique corrigée du terrain au-delà de la"
" correction en cosinus, vers la correction C, Minnaert ou SCS+C pour les "
"terrains escarpés ([Pipelines multi-"
"capteurs](../processing/multisensor.md))."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:37
msgid ""
"Re-verify providers whose upstream APIs may have changed. A failing provider"
" is a live bug report, not a stub to reimplement."
msgstr ""
"Revérifier les fournisseurs dont les API en amont ont pu changer. Un "
"fournisseur défaillant est un véritable rapport de bogue, pas une ébauche à "
"réimplémenter."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:39
msgid "Conventions"
msgstr "Conventions"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:41
msgid ""
"Add a test for every fix, and derive expected values independently of the "
"code under test."
msgstr ""
"Ajoutez un test pour chaque correction, et déduisez les valeurs attendues "
"indépendamment du code testé."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:42
msgid "Do not make tests depend on network access."
msgstr "Ne faites pas dépendre les tests de l'accès au réseau."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:43
msgid ""
"When you change a CLI command, regenerate its reference page: `python "
"tools/gen_cli_reference.py`."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque vous modifiez une commande CLI, régénérez sa page de référence : "
"`python tools/gen_cli_reference.py`."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:44
msgid ""
"Keep documentation claims verifiable: run the example before you publish it."
msgstr ""
"Gardez des affirmations de documentation vérifiables : exécutez l'exemple "
"avant de le publier."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:46
msgid "Licence"
msgstr "Licence"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/project/contributing.md:48
msgid ""
"MIT. Copyright Samuel Appiah Kubi. pygeofetch is part of the PyGeoVision "
"platform: pygeofetch handles data acquisition and processing, and "
"PyGeoVision builds the Earth observation machine-learning layer on top."
msgstr ""
"MIT. Copyright Samuel Appiah Kubi. pygeofetch fait partie de la plateforme "
"PyGeoVision : pygeofetch gère l'acquisition et le traitement des données, et"
" PyGeoVision construit par-dessus la couche d'apprentissage automatique pour"
" l'observation de la Terre."
